The retained upstream source snapshot and its original LICENSE and NOTICE are
kept under upstream/hydro-realboard. Upstream-only debug scripts that contained
the original maintainer's live server address and contest identifiers are not
distributed because they are not used by this package. The active league adapter in
frontend/league-realboard.page.tsx retains the fork's React components,
ranking model, two-stage queues, react-spring transitions, and CSS structure.
Its WebSocket input was replaced with the authenticated same-origin XCPCIO
all-in-one proxy, and compile errors were excluded from ACM penalty attempts.
These adaptations, the new route, reliable synchronization path, access
control, and server-side cache were added in 2026 by Hydro League Sync
contributors. The existing Realboard plugin and its route are not replaced.

This package also contains a separate `league-xcpcio` integration based on:

  @hydrooj/scoreboard-xcpcio 0.1.0
